WEBVTT

00:02.160 --> 00:03.600
Tonight we'll hold a banquet

00:03.680 --> 00:05.080
To entertain the envoy

00:06.840 --> 00:07.760
First take the envoy

00:07.840 --> 00:09.040
To rest

00:09.120 --> 00:10.520
Thank you, Your Highness

00:17.440 --> 00:18.320
Brother-in-law

00:18.400 --> 00:19.320
The northern expedition

00:19.400 --> 00:21.080
Affects everything with one move

00:21.760 --> 00:24.320
General Zu entrusted us with the strategic Yiyang

00:24.400 --> 00:25.920
Even if the seal is real

00:26.000 --> 00:28.280
Does brother-in-law really plan to turn south?

00:28.360 --> 00:30.027
Though it goes against righteousness

00:30.200 --> 00:31.680
The matter of going north

00:31.760 --> 00:33.427
Can wait for another opportunity

00:33.560 --> 00:34.080
One city

00:34.160 --> 00:35.080
One place

00:35.160 --> 00:36.560
Temporary gains and losses

00:37.000 --> 00:38.080
Indeed

00:38.160 --> 00:40.160
Cannot compare to the long term

00:40.360 --> 00:41.760
Your subject

00:41.960 --> 00:43.627
Asks Your Highness to reconsider
